			(property "Description" "Daly DL-J05G-L4S15ATJ Li-ion 4S 12 V 15 A common-port BMS with 30 mA passive balance. Terminals per Daly spec A0 §4.1 (TinyTronics 005102 download): B- lead (to pack negative), P- lead (charge/discharge negative), sampling connector PHB2.0 5-pin: 1=B0 (cell 1 negative), 2=B1+, 3=B2+, 4=B3+, 5=B4+ (4 and 5 by the spec pattern \"... last cell positive\"). Pack positive bypasses the BMS. STACK §2.7, §5.1."
