		(property "Description" "Adafruit INA228 breakout #5832 (85 V, 20-bit power/energy/charge monitor, on-board 15 mOhm 1% shunt between VIN+ and VIN-). Terminals per Adafruit learn guide pinouts: VIN, GND, SCL, SDA, ALRT (active low), VBUS, VIN+, VIN-; VBUS jumper (STACK \"SJ1\") ties VBUS to VIN+ for high-side; A0/A1 jumpers set address. STACK §2.7, §5.1: VIN from AON 3V3, ALRT pull-up only to 3V3_Q6A."
			(at 73.66 20.32 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
