		(property "Description" "Pololu D36V50Fx 5.5 A step-down regulator module (D36V50F12 #4095 = SYS12; D36V50F5 #4091 = LAB5 fallback). Terminals per Pololu product pages: VIN, VRP (VIN after reverse-voltage protection), VOUT, GND (each duplicated on the board, drawn once), EN (100k internal pull-up to VIN; <1.2 V sleep, >1.35 V wake), PG (open drain, external pull-up). STACK §2.7, §5.1."
