		(property "Description" "Pololu D36V28Fx 3.2 A step-down regulator module (D36V28F5 #3782 = LAB5). Six connections per Pololu: PG, EN, VIN, VOUT, 2x GND (drawn once). EN pulled up to VIN by 100k (<1.2 V sleep, >1.35 V wake); PG open drain, needs external pull-up. Back-feed above about 5 V on VOUT pumps VIN above 60 V (STACK §2.7, Pololu staff): SMBJ17A on node SW."
